at 693 -
at 714 right

# room 31, The Music Room -- the second star, again at v 14 h 128
at 773 -
at 803 right
at 839 -
at 857 right
at 872 -

# room 38, Number Seven, and east into room 39
at 896 right
at 934 -
at 955 right

# room 39, The Box Room
at 1014 -
at 1044 right
at 1080 -
at 1098 right
at 1113 -

# room 45, The Water Tank, and east into room 46
at 1137 right
at 1175 -
at 1196 right

# room 46, The Tower Stair -- the last flight
at 1255 -
at 1285 right
at 1321 -
at 1339 right
at 1354 -

# room 49, The Bell Turret -- east off the h 120 vent and up the h 336 one, which ends
# at the third star and the end of the house.
at 1378 right
at 1416 -
